<title>USA: AMEX December short interest rises.</title>
<headline>AMEX December short interest rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said short interest as of December 13 increased to 126,440,755 shares, an increase of 3,071,603 shares from the 123,369,152 shares (adjusted basis) from mid November.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
